{"content": "\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull\" style=\"min-height:200px;aspect-ratio:unset;\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-deep-atlantic-background-color has-background-dim-100 has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"font-size:3rem;font-weight:900\">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Everything you need to know about hydro excavation services</p>\n\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-base-background-color has-background is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4ac8c33d wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4rem;padding-bottom:4rem\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-deep-atlantic-color has-text-color\" style=\"font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:900\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"margin-bottom:2rem\">Get answers to common questions about hydro excavation services</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-flow wp-container-core-group-is-layout-215ed0c7 wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details has-border-color is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-color:#e5e7eb;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;padding-top:1rem;padding-right:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1rem;padding-left:1.5rem\">\n<summary><strong>What is hydro excavation?</strong></summary>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Hydro excavation (also called vacuum excavation or hydrovac) is a non-destructive digging method that uses pressurized water to break up soil and a powerful vacuum to remove the debris. This technique safely exposes underground utilities without risk of damage from traditional mechanical excavation methods.</p>\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details has-border-color is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-color:#e5e7eb;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;padding-top:1rem;padding-right:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1rem;padding-left:1.5rem\">\n<summary><strong>What areas do you serve?</strong></summary>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Beach Hydrovac provides hydro-excavation services throughout Virginia, North Carolina, Maryland, and Delaware. We are based in Virginia Beach and serve the entire Mid-Atlantic region including Hampton Roads, Norfolk, Chesapeake, Richmond, and surrounding areas.</p>\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details has-border-color is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-color:#e5e7eb;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;padding-top:1rem;padding-right:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1rem;padding-left:1.5rem\">\n<summary><strong>What is SUE Level A verification?</strong></summary>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:1rem\">SUE Level A is the highest accuracy level in Subsurface Utility Engineering as defined by ASCE standards. It involves physically exposing utilities through non-destructive excavation (like hydrovac) to obtain precise horizontal and vertical location data. This is required for critical infrastructure projects and provides legally defensible documentation.</p>\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details has-border-color is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-color:#e5e7eb;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;padding-top:1rem;padding-right:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1rem;padding-left:1.5rem\">\n<summary><strong>How far can your equipment reach?</strong></summary>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Our hydrovac trucks feature an extended 600-foot hose reach, allowing us to excavate in restricted-access areas where traditional equipment cannot go. This includes behind buildings, in landscaped areas, on slopes, and in tight urban spaces.</p>\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details has-border-color is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-color:#e5e7eb;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;padding-top:1rem;padding-right:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1rem;padding-left:1.5rem\">\n<summary><strong>What industries do you serve?</strong></summary>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:1rem\">We serve electrical contractors, civil contractors, water and sewer utilities (including HRSD), telecom companies, municipalities, and engineering firms. Our precision excavation services are trusted for fiber optic installation, power line work, utility upgrades, and infrastructure verification projects.</p>\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details has-border-color is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-color:#e5e7eb;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;padding-top:1rem;padding-right:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1rem;padding-left:1.5rem\">\n<summary><strong>Is hydro excavation safer than traditional excavation?</strong></summary>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Yes, hydro excavation is significantly safer than mechanical excavation. It eliminates the risk of utility strikes that can cause injuries, service outages, and expensive repairs. The non-destructive nature protects gas lines, electrical cables, fiber optics, and water mains during excavation.</p>\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details has-border-color is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-color:#e5e7eb;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;padding-top:1rem;padding-right:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1rem;padding-left:1.5rem\">\n<summary><strong>Can you work in cold weather?</strong></summary>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Yes, hydro excavation works effectively in cold weather and frozen ground conditions when traditional excavation methods struggle. Our heated water systems can break through frost and frozen soil, making it ideal for year-round utility work in the Mid-Atlantic region.</p>\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details has-border-color is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-color:#e5e7eb;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;padding-top:1rem;padding-right:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1rem;padding-left:1.5rem\">\n<summary><strong>How do I get a quote?</strong></summary>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Contact us at 757-510-5220 or email info@beachhydrovac.com for a free quote. We will discuss your project requirements, timeline, and provide competitive pricing. As a veteran-owned local business, we pride ourselves on responsive service and fair pricing.</p>\n\n</details>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-9545b597 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgb(0,65,106) 0%,rgb(39,174,253) 100%);padding-top:3rem;padding-bottom:3rem\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-8fb548be178bca68b049c31f95014c54\" style=\"font-size:2rem;font-weight:800\">Still Have Questions?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-4e22e9b5cb069641462df15f283d9c2b\">We&#8217;re here to help! Contact our team for personalized answers.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-a89b3969 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-warm-shoreline-background-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"tel:7575105220\" style=\"border-radius:9999px;padding-top:0.875rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-bottom:0.875rem;padding-left:2rem\">Call 757-510-5220</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-deep-atlantic-color has-white-background-color has-text-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/contact/\" style=\"border-radius:9999px;padding-top:0.875rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-bottom:0.875rem;padding-left:2rem\">Contact Us</a></div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-top:30px;padding:20px 25px;background:#f8f9fa;border-left:4px solid #1a73e8;border-radius:4px;\">\n  <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:18px;color:#333;\">Related Resources</h3>\n  <ul style=\"margin:0;padding:0 0 0 20px;line-height:1.8;\">\n      <li><a href=\"https://beachhydrovac.com/what-is-hydro-excavation/\" style=\"color:#1a73e8;text-decoration:none;\">What is Hydro Excavation? Complete Guide</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"https://beachhydrovac.com/hydro-excavation-cost-guide-virginia-2026/\" style=\"color:#1a73e8;text-decoration:none;\">Hydro Excavation Cost Guide Virginia 2026</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"https://beachhydrovac.com/services/\" style=\"color:#1a73e8;text-decoration:none;\">View All Our Services</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"https://beachhydrovac.com/virginia-811-miss-utility-guide/\" style=\"color:#1a73e8;text-decoration:none;\">Virginia 811 Miss Utility Guide</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"https://beachhydrovac.com/service-areas/\" style=\"color:#1a73e8;text-decoration:none;\">Service Areas Across Virginia</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin-top:25px;padding:20px 25px;background:#0f2134;border-radius:6px;text-align:center;\">\n  <p style=\"color:#fff;margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:16px;\">Ready to get started? Get a free quote today.</p>\n  <a href=\"https://beachhydrovac.com/contact/\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 30px;background:#e8a020;color:#0f2134;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;\">Request a Free Quote</a>\n  <p style=\"color:#ccc;margin:10px 0 0 0;font-size:14px;\">Or call us at <a href=\"tel:7575105220\" style=\"color:#e8a020;text-decoration:none;\">757-510-5220</a></p>\n</div>\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"@id\": \"https://beachhydrovac.com/faq/#faqpage\",\n  \"url\": \"https:/